## UI Automation & Tag Conventions
- **Tags & texts queried in tests:**  
  - `ArcadeTestTags.*` (e.g. `PulseOrbitEntry`, `StackDropEntry`, `LaneDriftEntry`, `PulseOrbitBoard`, etc.)
- **Navigation tests** expect to click on elements containing card/game names like "Pulse Orbit", "Lane Drift", "Stack Drop", etc.
- **UI test helper**: core helper in DeviceTestHelpers.kt:
  - `waitUntilExists(tag)`
  - `openHomeRoute(entryTag, screenTag)`
- **Important:** All UI elements used in tests MUST be rendered and tagged or contain the text values as expected.

## Known Sources of Flakiness / Debug Hints
- Timeouts in tests are 30 seconds, but emulators may still be slow; consider raising if needed.
- Intro/hint dialogs or permission popups can block elements; dismiss automatically in test setup.
- Ensure ArcadeTestTags and actual composable tags are in sync.
- Use extra `.assertExists()` or debug screenshot logic on failure.

## Test Coverage
- Core flows: Navigation from home, launching/canceling games, dismissing hints, back navigation, pause/resume, general UI responsiveness.
- ADB monkey and smoke tests cover tap/swipe/back and offline behavior.

